WEBVTT

00:03:58.526 --> 00:04:01.404
without a formal diagnosis
of mental health,

00:04:01.445 --> 00:04:04.865
and our interventions focus
on building character strengths,

00:04:04.865 --> 00:04:07.076
on strengthening individual autonomy

00:04:07.118 --> 00:04:10.788
and on improving overall
human functioning and well-being.

00:04:11.872 --> 00:04:15.042
Because our lay providers
work within the communities

00:04:15.084 --> 00:04:16.377
where they come from,

00:04:16.419 --> 00:04:19.005
in the school systems
that they themselves went to

00:04:19.046 --> 00:04:24.051
and deliver what is truly a for-youth
and by-youth mental health care treatment,

00:04:24.093 --> 00:04:29.056
we are fixing the divide
between mental health treatment

00:04:29.056 --> 00:04:33.686
and the social and cultural needs
of the communities that they serve.